MiB gate.\n34 original hardware D3D12 images / 17 before-after pairs: 1080p/4K, three zooms, Low/Medium/High, dark/wet, 1/100/1000 artillery and actual LOD0 inspections. Every eight-repeat image set agrees; zero fallback/binding failures; all paired instance/draw/material/resource counters match. Thirteen pairs are pixel-exact; four total 30 changed pixels, maximum channel delta 2, with no tolerance/golden change.\nLOD0 close loads retain six draws: 84 visible of 100 input actors and 125 of 1000 (1,625 rigid-part instances). Normal 1000 uses 979 visible LOD1 actors. Counts distinguish input, culling and motion visibility.\nReproducible 0.1.429-dev player ZIP; all 1,487 fresh-extraction hashes verify. Published/extracted fresh-settings smokes exit 0 with packaged assets and system/.NET-only child PATH, zero authoring/compiler files. All 1,364 common catalog/payload files match byte-for-byte; the package adds 63 existing audio/branding files, so native whole-directory fingerprints correctly differ.\nActual extracted-player gallery, LOD0 single and close-1000 images match development pixels exactly. There are 37 original images total; eleven unchanged selected PNGs and all raw manifest/request/comparison references are checked in. Complete local capture roots and original hashes are mapped in the report.","timestamp":"2026-10-21T09:48:38Z","author":{"name":"Dave Beusing","email":"david.beusing@gmail.com"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com"}},"repository":{"id":1384260145,"node_id":"R_kgDOUoIiMQ","name":"Forgeline","full_name":"DaveBeusing/Forgeline","private":false,"owner":{"login":"DaveBeusing","id":4300155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzMDAxNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4300155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveBeusing","html_url":"https://github.com/DaveBeusing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveBeusing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DaveBeusing/followi